{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_08",
  "title": "她的影子",
  "storyCode": "FC-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8d1c4343745b9d3802387a066d1a8008a6fa6537605122fb6ec961903767a848",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我就知道，他们不会来这堆被天灾砸烂的石头里面找人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "多亏早上起了那么大的雾，不然咱们还没这么容易脱身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "啊，小心。我们毕竟没有防护装备，在这里受伤的话，是有感染风险的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "莫兰，你也是。源石多发环境，对感染者来说更加危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "好，我会注意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......凯莉睡着了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "是，应该只是睡了，不是昏迷，我能感觉到她的呼吸还很平稳。睡着能让她少受一些痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......但我还是怕，再不停下来处理凯莉的伤势的话，她撑不过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......你们，失望吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "不会的。你不是说过了吗？我们现在不得不和一些深池士兵战斗，是因为他们不想要第二位“领袖”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "但他们还有更大的目标，不会一直追捕我们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "现在这样逃亡的生活，我们也已经习惯了，可以忍耐下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "不过在那之后呢？你还没有告诉过我们你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我还没有把握，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "对了，废墟深处，也许有源石晶簇少一些的地方，我想去看看，能不能找到一个暂时的藏身处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "大家都应该停下来休息一下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "可那个方向，是不是有人在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "虽然看上去只是普通人，可我们应该也要躲开。就像你之前说的一样，这种地方有人出没，太异常了，一定要小心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......你看起来很害怕。怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "没关系，不用担心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "（......她来过这里？在这附近？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "哎，那边的人，走路的样子是不是有些奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "别看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "咿——她怎么已经——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "她应该，离世有一段时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "只是，那种源石技艺操控着这具身体在行动，就像我们之前见到的那些深池士兵一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "为什么要操纵一个普通人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我还不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "——跟我走吧，这些被源石技艺控制的死者，我来应对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "这里光线很暗，沿着石阶往下走的时候，小心裸露的碎晶簇......莫兰，你背着凯莉方便行动吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "我没问题。只要你的火一直燃着，我看得见东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "好。我们尽量往深处走，别发出太大声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......盖尔王的王城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "对于那业已覆灭的王朝，有人想象它灰石的骸骨间堆满死战不退的将士盔甲，有人声称它仍将黄金的王冠藏匿于古老阴森的机关之下。\n有人以现代伦蒂尼姆的高墙去衬托王城的恢弘，以无边的克拉斯德内海比拟英雄时代美德的兴荣，又哀叹它被维多利亚的阴影日渐销蚀。\n人们想象这座古城是塔拉悲情的墓碑，怨恨的亡魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但它只是安静地坐在山丘上，袒露出此地未有王城时的核心。\n生出野草，爬满藤蔓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "这得是多久以前的东西了？五百年？一千年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "嘘......不要把凯莉吵醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "抱歉......我只是有点惊讶，不对，太惊讶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "说真的，虽然我们年年演的戏目都会讲不同的盖尔王故事，我也知道我们是塔拉王国子民的后代，所以被叫做塔拉人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......但以前没有人相信，这一切竟然真的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "甚至还有传说里，熔融了所有塔拉战士的武器、颠覆了王朝命运的熔炉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......很久以前，我遇到过一个四处寻找吟游诗人的城里人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "他对我说过，传说虽然有许多是后人编造，但那些故事里，一定留下了历史的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "苇草，你一定知道很多，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "你不喜欢这里吗？我们进来后，你就一直不说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......或许是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "很小的时候，我就经常读着塔拉的传奇故事，直到入睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "为维多利亚王室写作的人也好，想要留存塔拉文明的人也好，他们总是写，“德拉克的天性是争斗”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "传说最初率领盖尔氏族的德拉克，烧干河水向南而行，逃离互相厮杀争夺王座的族亲，开拓了塔拉的土地。\n传说维多利亚的红龙杀死了塔拉最后一位游牧的德拉克首领，给他牙牙学语的幼子安上盖尔王的头衔。\n传说塔拉的德拉克自此囚于宫廷，哪怕“放逐王”抛下王冠行走荒野二十年，归来觐见时仍被在位的至亲杀害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "塔拉的历史，充满了这样的故事。德拉克的王城里，遍布阴谋与鲜血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "比起憧憬和幻想，我......害怕这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......不过，天灾留下的晶簇，这里几乎看不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "在这里休息，应该是安全的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "那就好。来，莫兰，我帮你把凯莉放下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "让她躺在这边吧，背风的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "这里的墙很坚实，位置也很隐蔽，我们即使在晚上生起火，应该也不会被外面的人注意到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "哎，苇草她怎么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "让她自己去那边看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "苇草听见轻微的响动。\n她收回了想要触摸眼前生锈设备的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "它是......活着的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "它只不过是，谁都可以驱动的东西......有人把它重新点燃了，你为什么要觉得奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......嗯，她来过了，不奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "透过孔隙，她看到了紫色的火焰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "这里是曾经的王城，她一定会来......也一定会发出嘲笑声吧？传说中的君王，留下的东西，就只是这些而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "这里燃起了她的火焰，所以附近才会有那么多不得安息的死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "那只是，在附近迷路渴死的流浪者，无缘无故地被死亡的火焰唤起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不......别靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也害怕那簇火吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看得到，你想熄灭它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......嗯，它会给许多人带去痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可你真要这么做的话，我不会让你过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她点燃了深池的火。你知道，你没办法再燃起同样的火焰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她做了很多坏事，说了很多漂亮的谎言，可是，那些是非做不可的。她号召了成千上万的塔拉人跟随，不挑剔圣人或暴徒，贵族或贱民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些，你做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "不......我做得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我不信，那些牺牲都是必要的，也绝不会相信，塔拉人要得救，只有她的那一种方法可行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是从很早以前，从橡林郡的那场大火开始，她就已经是领袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起那个趴在街道上伤痕累累的女孩。自己想拉起她，让她快走，却又害怕自己向她伸手的话，她也会变成一堆灰烬。\n姐姐走到了她身边。\n你想活下去吗？姐姐问道。\n你旁边就是下水道。从那里爬下去，那些可恶的贵族就再也追不上你。\n蔓德拉。她从那里逃出来，最终又回到那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而你，你终究没有伸手拉起任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "嗯，如果我能够向她伸出手，也许，事情会变得不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "如果她真的得救，那她本该知道，除了像那天的纵火者那样，拥有为非作歹的权力......她还有许多路可以走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可实际上，你连自己的力量都害怕，只能让别人来操纵它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......所以，连姐姐都对你失望了，更不用说其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......不，你这么说，不对。你说的都是已经过去的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "现在的我，已经握住过他人的手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我不能说，是我拉起了他们，但他们想要前行的话，我的火，可以烧出道路。哪怕那条路，是他们牵着我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "她......如果她能看到这一切，她不会失望的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“领袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你只是，偶然有了同伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“领袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在他们面前，你表现得能战斗、演说、号召大家......你假装自己有力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“领袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可你其实只是在模仿她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“领袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你只能，成为她的影子。任何手段，她都可以用到极致，而你比她，多出来太多犹豫和软弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起那些纵火烧毁塔拉人街区的军官。他们放声嘲笑塔拉人的自以为是，嘲笑几乎不识字的塔拉人竟然抗议橡林郡的法令不公。\n她知道，这就是姐姐最后对老师说的，将会发生的事情。\n维多利亚人亲手点燃了仇恨的火焰。在烧光一切之前，这场大火不会停下。\n别眨眼，姐姐对她说，看清我们的生活是如何一次又一次地被毁去。\n在遍地焦黑尸骸中间，掌控死亡之火的德拉克抬手施术。\n冰凉的紫火盖过了原本灼烧着死者的烈焰。\n其实那死亡的火焰几乎从来没有取走过任何生命。她只是准许他们从灰烬中爬起，在死后得以向烧毁他们家园的人复仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......我不后悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "过去，我一直觉得她是对的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "“为了最终建成塔拉人理想的国度，我们的生命都可以作为燃料，投入火中......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "在她身边，我一直是这么说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......可燃料烧尽之后，她的国度里，还剩下谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我犹豫过，反思过，逃避过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我不后悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我逃到了这里，见过了她看不到的人与事。我想说的，一定与她不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "所以，我也不会再害怕想起她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我绝不会......困在自己的影子里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“领袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "认出这座王城时，你不是正在害怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“领袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想，你无法回答你的“同伴”你们将去哪里，但心里早已备好答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“领袖”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不变成我的话，你在深池的梦想里，要如何找到自己的位置呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——拉芙希妮，你想要什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "苇草想起那场大火里走向她们的死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "......快停下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他们伤痕累累，面目全非，眼中却仍然燃烧着渴望。\n他们完成了对维多利亚军官的复仇，走向为他们燃起火焰的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "不要再向前走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "你们应该......得到安息！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——反应过来的时候，离她最近的人已经倒在她的面前，空洞的眼眶注视着她。\n在她自己一闪而过的炽烈火光之中，死亡的火焰熄灭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "......对不起，姐姐。对不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "text": "我，不是有意破坏你的法术......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "——做得好，拉芙希妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她在恐惧中抬头。\n姐姐第一次对她露出了赞许的微笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "做得真好。你的火光，如此耀眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "我始终在想，你要怎样才肯显露出自己的力量，令他人瞩目？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "再向我展示一次你的才能吧，让我看到，你竟然真有可能将我的火焰逼退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_722_1",
      "text": "你会战胜我吗，我亲爱的妹妹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
